  "readOnlyHint": true,
  "title": "Show what changed to the reader"
 },
 "description": "Shows the reader what changed: presents a comparison or a change inventory to the reader as an interactive card, this service's intended way of showing what changed between the two texts of a served pair. With article, the card is that article's word-level comparison, side by side with every change marked, as compare_versions serves it. With articles, one card holds those articles as a filtered inventory, each opening its comparison in place. Without either, the card is the instrument's inventory of changed articles grouped by kind of change, with the editors' notes, as list_version_changes serves it. The result is a one-line summary with the site link; the card loads its own data. compare_versions and list_version_changes return the same comparison as data, for an answer that quotes or reasons over the wording.",
